    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">substantial resource underutilization. An interactive cluster might be overwhelmed during peak hours, while a batch processing fleet remains largely idle</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
