    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">we place all non-expert weights and a portion of experts, in multiple precision versions, in GPU memory</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Weight memory corresponds to the static storage of model parameters</hasEvidenceText>
