  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/S0/R1#prefillphase">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://example.org/S0/R1#computeboundphase"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PrefillPhase</rdfs:label>
    <skos:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Prefill Phase</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">prefill phase</skos:altLabel>
    <skos:skos_definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The initial phase of LLM inference where the input prompt is processed, the first output token is produced, and KV caches are generated.</skos:skos_definition>
    <hasCQ rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0001</hasCQ>
    <hasCQ rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0046</hasCQ>
    <hasCQ rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0049</hasCQ>
    <hasCQ rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0147</hasCQ>
    <hasCQ rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0162</hasCQ>
    <hasCQ rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0214</hasCQ>
    <hasCQ rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0237</hasCQ>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0001</prov:wasDerivedFrom>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0046</prov:wasDerivedFrom>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0049</prov:wasDerivedFrom>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0147</prov:wasDerivedFrom>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0162</prov:wasDerivedFrom>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0214</prov:wasDerivedFrom>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0237</prov:wasDerivedFrom>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2507.09019_rag::chunk_002</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2403.01136_rag::chunk_003</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2410.17840_rag::chunk_007</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2401.11181_rag::chunk_003</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2308.16369_rag::chunk_001</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2509.24381_rag::chunk_007</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2410.18038_rag::chunk_003</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2503.18599_rag::chunk_006</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">During prefill phase, the users input prompt is processed and first output token is produced.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In the prefill phase, the input prompt sequence produces key/value (KV) caches for each transformer layer</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The LLM may batch several tokens of the user prompt together and propagate them through the LLM as one batch. This typically makes the prefill phase compute-bound</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The prefill phase outputs the first token and generates the key and value cache (KV cache) for future decoding</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">a prefill phase corresponding to the processing of the input prompt</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the prefill phase cannot start until all multimodal data has been fully encoded</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The prefill phase processes the tokens of a users prompt in parallel and produces the first output token</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the prefill phase for batched requests is also parallelizable across multiple cores, resulting in high core utilization.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
