    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The state-of-the-art methods include LoRA ( Hu et al. , 2021 ), Prefix-tuning ( Li &amp; Liang , 2021 ), P-Tuning ( Liu et al. , 2021 ), Prompt tuning ( Liu et al. , 2023 ; Lester et al. , 2021 ), AdaLoRA ( Zhang et al. , 2022 )</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
