    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2503.18599_rag::chunk_008</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2503.18599_rag::chunk_006</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the LLM accelerators [ 53 , 83 ]. Despite the industrys growing demand for large-scale LLM inference, current memory technologies struggle to meet both capacity and bandwidth requirements</hasEvidenceText>
