    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">With the help of online batching [ 31 ], larger batch sizes can be easily achieved and become more frequent than the small batch siz</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
