    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">performance of different techniques on a deployment of four servers, each containing two H100 GPUs and running a Llama-3 70B replica</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
